- entry .Formulaic   a type which can be presented as form rows: derived for case classes, field by field
+ entry .Formulaic   un tipo que puede presentarse como filas de formulario: derivado para case classes, campo a campo

= entry .Formulaic   a type which can be presented as form rows: derived for case classes, field by field
-   detail
+   detail

-       `Formulaic` is the typeclass `elicit` and `edit` need. It is derived for a product type
-       from its fields — each field must itself be `Formulaic` — and is given for any single
-       value which is `Elicitable` and whose widget is `Renderable` as phrasing HTML. A
-       derived product renders as a `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>`, so nesting in the data is
-       nesting in the form.
+       `Formulaic` es la clase de tipos que necesitan `elicit` y `edit`. Se deriva para un tipo
+       producto a partir de sus campos (cada campo debe ser a su vez `Formulaic`) y se da para
+       cualquier valor individual que sea `Elicitable` y cuyo widget sea `Renderable` como HTML
+       de fraseo. Un producto derivado se representa como un `<fieldset>` con un `<legend>`, de
+       modo que el anidamiento en los datos es anidamiento en el formulario.

-       `#fields` receives the `Pointer` of the value within the whole form, its legend, the
-       part of the submitted `Query` under that pointer, the `Validation` and the `Formulation`;
-       a single field looks up its own message in the validation by its pointer.
+       `#fields` recibe el `Pointer` del valor dentro del formulario completo, su leyenda, la
+       parte de la `Query` enviada bajo ese puntero, la `Validation` y el `Formulation`; un
+       campo individual busca su propio mensaje en la validación por su puntero.

